Error [E0112]: `ExpiringSecret<T>` requires a secret type
  --> expiring_secret_declared_type_enforces_closed_family.jet:2:15
    |
  2 | fn bad(value: ExpiringSecret<String>) {
    |               ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: Only Secret, SigningKey, and X25519SecretKey have the audited move-only zeroizing contract required by this wrapper
 Fix: Use `ExpiringSecret<crypto.Secret>`, `ExpiringSecret<crypto.SigningKey>`, or `ExpiringSecret<crypto.X25519SecretKey>`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0112
